  "goodToKnow": "Der Teig is dough or batter: Hefeteig (yeast dough), Mürbeteig (shortcrust), Blätterteig (puff pastry), Rührteig (cake batter). Den Teig kneten, ausrollen, gehen lassen (to let it rise). Germany has more than 3,000 registered bread varieties, and German bread culture was added to the national list of intangible cultural heritage in 2014. Teigwaren is the official term for pasta. Plural: die Teige."
